  "title": "· New Bags | Saint Laurent Debuts the 2026 Winter Simone Bag: An Envelope Silhouette ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Saint Laurent 上架2026冬季新款 Simone 手袋：信封廓形",
  "excerpt": "Saint Laurent's Winter 2026 Simone handbag features an envelope silhouette inspired by Yves Saint Laurent's personal letters, with a three-dimensional YSL emblem.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-21",
  "date_label": "October 21, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/15eiks7/686dcf9d82a7577f.jpg",
