    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Saint Laurent's Winter 2026 collection introduces a new handbag, the «Simone», inspired by handwritten letters exchanged between founder Yves Saint Laurent and his closest friends. The bag pairs a distinctive envelope silhouette with a double, three-dimensional YSL Cassandre metal emblem, striking a deft balance between supple leather and clean lines for a look that is at once elegant and poised.",
