    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Simone comes in two sizes, large and medium. The large measures 43x24.5x13cm and is crafted from soft calfskin, its envelope construction recalling the art of origami. A double YSL Cassandre emblem in brass creates a sculptural, three-dimensional effect that instantly draws the eye.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/15eiks7/704c867de245b1de.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/15eiks7/30ae4674d82e57ab.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sides of the bag form a triangular shape — narrow at the top and wider at the base — a subtle echo of the envelope flap that also lowers the bag's center of gravity for a more grounded silhouette. Inside, two compartments and a zipped pocket keep everything neatly organized. Slim leather handles emerge from the center of the body, allowing the bag to be carried by hand or on the shoulder, lending it an air of elegance.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
