    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Alongside the classic black-and-gold combination, the large size also comes in a deep orange smooth calfskin version, its warm, radiant hue adding a highlight to fall and winter looks. A dark olive suede style offers a soft, refined hand feel and an effortlessly relaxed mood.",
