    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The medium Simone measures 38x22.5x11cm — still roomy enough for a 13-inch laptop. Its crisp envelope silhouette and finely judged YSL Cassandre emblem define the image of a YSL woman who is composed yet never without an edge. It is offered in four material and color variations: dark olive suede, black and raspberry grained calfskin, and cognac python.",
